msgid "date_time_format_help_text"
msgstr "<summary>Date &amp; Time Format</summary>"
"<p>The date and time format options are used to transform dates and times into a human-readable format, using the "
"<a href=\"https://unicode-org.github.io/icu/userguide/format_parse/datetime/#datetime-format-syntax\" target=\"_blank\">ICU Date Format</a> "
"and the provided language region.</p>"
"<p>Examples:</p>"
"<ul>"
"<li><code>EEE, d. MMMM, ''yy</code> results in \"Mon, 1. Januar, '23\" with the German locale</li>"
"<li><code>d 'de' MMMM, H:mm</code> results in \"2 de abril, 17:00\" with the Spanish locale</li>"
"<li><code>HH:mm 'Uhr</code> results in \"13:37 Uhr\"</li>"
"<li><code>hh 'o''clock' a, zzzz</code> results in \"12 o’clock PM, Pacific Daylight Time\" with the English locale</li>"
"</ul>"